m/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262580/extras/606f6af35de041f7c780f4e5fcdc9742.avif?t=1745051379\" width=620 height=440 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Choices:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is designed based on <i>Slay the Spire</i>, allowing players to freely choose their encounter paths. Each floor presents different opponents and events, so you might need specific enemies or card sets to progress, or you could choose to power through everything to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262580/extras/a396b5139105467329b0e5074561fbe8.avif?t=1745051379\" width=620 height=360 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card types, forge and upgrade:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262580/extras/7da5bdad33efa074150d27013fbad5cf.avif?t=1745051379\" width=620 height=371 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reverse side of the card\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262580/extras/4c72fc4403e6c0f4ba11284ca7663a9a.avif?t=1745051379\" width=620 height=457 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan\uff1a</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262580/extras/b706275949ec1f99adc55737bba210b9.avif?t=1745051379\" width=620 height=457 /></span></p>",
